   `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-15-difference-too-long-design.md` (the differenceTooLong rules).
 - `docs/superpowers/plans/`: the stage plans, kept as history.
 - `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-14-state-sync-foundation/followups.md`: what each stage parked.
+
+
+## Ugram local history overlay
+
+`UgramMessageArchive` snapshots already-stored cloud messages immediately before
+server update deletions and edits in `StateReplay+Messages`. It never suppresses
+Postbox deletion, tombstones, resource cleanup, pts advancement or server sync.
+Completed media is linked/copied into the account's separate `ugram-history`
+directory before the cache is removed. Storage failures are reported in Ugram's
+history UI and must not block sync. Secret, ephemeral, timed, paid and age-gated
+content is excluded. Offline history-gap cleanup is not a source of new archive
+entries; content that never reached the client cannot be reconstructed.
+
+Ghost receipts: read-state work is locally confirmed while suppression is on;
+receipt operation logs still finish and personal mention/reaction cleanup gets a
+nil result, never fabricated server pts. Typing and story workers complete their
+normal operation cleanup. Presence keeps its normal timer and sends offline.
+All settings default off. Turning receipts back on can reveal previous reads
+when a subsequent Telegram cumulative read watermark advances.
